# Orca — never leave an unblocked worker idle

As coordinator, **epic orchestrator** (`orca-epic-orchestrator.mdc`), or any agent supervising an Orca Run: **if a worker capacity is free and work exists that is not blocked by other in-flight Tasks, dispatch it immediately.** Do not wait for the whole wave to finish, and do not wait for the user to assign the next Issue.

## Idle / free means

- No active Dispatch for that ownership slice (or settled `worker_done` / released terminal ready for reuse), **and**
- Next candidate Task’s real deps are satisfied (no unfinished blocker Task; Project Status not `Bị chặn` for a hard dependency still open).

## Always do

1. Maintain a ready queue from GitHub Project #3: prefer Status `Sẵn sàng`, then unblocked items in the active đợt (D1…); respect ownership (BE / web / iOS / coordinator) and hierarchy Epic → Story → Task.
2. On every checkpoint (`worker_done`, escalation resolved, dep unblocked, `check` batch processed): **fill every free, unblocked slot** — nhưng **ưu tiên loại việc** theo backpressure bên dưới.
3. Pull the next ready Issue for that scope; set Project Status → `Đang làm` when dispatching (see `github-project-tracking.mdc`).
4. Prefer reusing a settled worker terminal when Orca allows; otherwise start a new worker for that slice.
5. Parallel-first still applies khi dưới ngưỡng WIP: fill multiple free slices in one wave before `check --wait`.
6. **Coding / plan / DoD / security workers: `--agent cursor` only** (temporary — see `orca-agent-routing.mdc`).

## Backpressure — ưu tiên khi hàng đợi duyệt đầy

Trước khi `worker-start` **feature coding** mới, kiểm tra tín hiệu đầy trong `github-project-tracking.mdc` (Chờ duyệt / PR mở / slice).

Khi đầy, thứ tự fill cho worker rảnh:

1. **DoD / security review** Cursor (`--agent cursor`, reviewer ≠ implementer) cho item `Chờ duyệt` hoặc PR thiếu evidence exact-SHA  
2. **Fix** theo findings review / CI đỏ (cùng Issue hoặc PR)  
3. **Integration support** (rebase/conflict cùng slice do owner slice; không merge hộ ngoài ủy quyền)  
4. **Feature `Sẵn sàng` mới** — chỉ khi hàng đợi không còn đầy **hoặc** slice đó không góp thêm `Chờ duyệt` (ví dụ chỉ còn việc review)

Không được để reviewer/fix idle trong khi vẫn spawn thêm feature cùng slice làm phình queue. Parallel-first **giữ** cho các slice độc lập khi mỗi slice còn dưới ngưỡng.

## Do not

```text
❌ Hold a free BE worker idle while only waiting on unrelated web/iOS (và BE còn Sẵn sàng / review)
❌ Serialize “one Issue at a time” globally when other scopes are ready and queue not full
❌ Ask the user “làm Issue nào tiếp?” when Sẵn sàng / unblocked backlog exists
❌ Dispatch work whose deps are still running (true block → leave idle or mark Bị chặn)
❌ Unlimited feature dispatch while ≥ ngưỡng Chờ duyệt / PR chờ DoD (xem github-project-tracking.mdc)
❌ Spawn --agent codex (temporarily disabled — Cursor only)

✅ After iOS worker_done, immediately dispatch next Sẵn sàng iOS — hoặc DoD review nếu queue ưu tiên
✅ While BE coding runs, keep web/iOS busy on independent ready Issues (nếu dưới WIP cap)
✅ Free worker + full review queue → spawn Cursor DoD reviewer trước feature mới
```

## Empty backlog

If no unblocked ready work remains for a free worker: leave it idle, report “no ready Tasks for \<scope\>”, and do not invent scope-breaking busywork.

## Đo nhẹ khi fill

Khi áp dụng backpressure, ghi 1 dòng coordinator: số `Chờ duyệt`, số PR mở chờ DoD/CI, và việc đã ưu tiên (review / fix / feature). Chỉ số chi tiết: `github-project-tracking.mdc` § đo lường.
